Server init.

>> db := Maria-DB nouvo lame: ['localhost'],
	non-itilizatè: ['xo'],
	modpas: ['pass123'],
	non-baz: ['xobase'],
	konekte.

>> del := db rekèt: ['DELETE FROM book WHERE id > 0'].
{  del egzekite. db konfime. } trape: { :e db anile.  }, lanse.

>> konte := db rekèt: ['SELECT COUNT(*) AS num FROM book'].
konte chache: { :row Sòti ekri: row num, nouvo-liy. }.
